  "steps": [
    "Put the couscous in a large bowl, add the boiling water, cover, and leave for 5 minutes until the grains are tender and have absorbed the liquid.",
    "Fluff the couscous with a fork, then stir in the olive oil, lemon juice, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper so the grains are evenly seasoned.",
    "Add the chickpeas, raisins, red onion, cucumber, cherry tomatoes, parsley, and mint. Toss well until everything is combined.",
    "Taste and adjust with a little more salt or lemon juice if needed, then serve immediately or chill for 15 minutes for a fresher salad."
